"learning period, advice is based on general agricultural knowledge and may "
"not be specific to your conditions. Your feedback — confirming, adjusting, "
"or rejecting suggestions — is what calibrates the system to your facility. "
"The system will tell you when it is uncertain and what confirmation would "
"help. You remain in control: no automated actions will be taken without your"
" approval."
