"Voltage threshold for switching to power-saving mode (4S LiFePO4: 13.00 V ≈ "
"25%; lead-acid 12 V: 11.70 V)"
msgstr "省電力モードに切り替える電圧しきい値 (4Sリン酸鉄: 13.00V ≈ 25%、鉛蓄電池12V: 11.70V)"

#. lorawan_mode_manager — battery thresholds retuned for 4S LiFePO4
msgid ""
"Voltage threshold for switching to ultra-saving mode (4S LiFePO4: 12.80 V ≈ "
"10%, past the knee; lead-acid 12 V: 11.40 V)"
msgstr "超省電力モードに切り替える電圧しきい値 (4Sリン酸鉄: 12.80V ≈ 10%、ニー以下、鉛蓄電池12V: 11.40V)"

