msgid "Start / germination date. Pick from the calendar. The date is interpreted in the device/facility local timezone (the system stores it as UTC internally — no manual conversion needed). Used to compute weeks_elapsed for all Method curves. Leave empty to disable week-based progression (Methods use wall-clock day only)."
